Data collected from all 32 nodes. Looking at the P291 line format, then aggregating.
Format confirmed; `realms` is epoch-ms so cross-node merge works. Writing the aggregation script (in `scripts/` per RULE 3).
1982 records exist on this ino but my parser only matched 369 total — line format variance. Checking.
